# Cloudflare Pages headers.
# HTML must never be reused from cache/bfcache, so a soft refresh always
# fetches the index.html that references the latest hashed JS bundle (a stale
# bundle points at the old *.workers.dev API, which Brave/blockers block).
# Hashed /assets/* are content-addressed, so cache them hard.

/*
  Cache-Control: no-store

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
